pageType: content
background: {type: solid, color: "$bg"}
notes: 转化页：桑基图看会员漏斗——进店到消费 74% 还行，注册后 90 天复购 63% 说明会员引擎健康；真正贵的是"进店客流"这一层，所以预算要从曝光端挪一点到门店体验和自提补贴。
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 42, 520, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "03 · 运营 会员转化 MEMBER FUNNEL"
  - elementId: dot1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [862, 44, 8, 8]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: dot2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [876, 44, 8, 8]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: dot3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [890, 44, 8, 8]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: dot4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [904, 44, 8, 8]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: dot5
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [918, 44, 8, 8]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 840, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 进店到消费 74%，注册后 90 天复购 63%：漏斗后段健康
  - elementId: chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [60, 122, 840, 354]
    fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
    data:
      cols: [来源, 去向, 万人]
      rows:
        - [内容曝光, 进店客流, 420]
        - [内容曝光, 线上商城, 180]
        - [进店客流, 就餐消费, 310]
        - [进店客流, 流失, 110]
        - [线上商城, 到店自提, 120]
        - [线上商城, 流失, 60]
        - [就餐消费, 注册会员, 240]
        - [就餐消费, 非会员消费, 70]
        - [注册会员, 90天复购, 150]
        - [注册会员, 沉睡, 90]
    series:
      - type: sankey
        encode: {source: 来源, target: 去向, flow: 万人}
        nodeAlign: justify
        fill: ["$primary", "$accent", "$accent3", "$accent4", "$accent5", "$accent6"]
        dataLabels: {show: true, fontSize: 10, color: "$text"}
  - elementId: t1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 434, 260, 36]
    content:
      style: "$statNum"
      fontSize: 24
      text: 74%
  - elementId: t1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 470, 260, 22]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 进店客流就餐转化
  - elementId: t2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 434, 280, 36]
    content:
      style: "$statNum"
      fontSize: 24
      text: 77%
  - elementId: t2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 470, 280, 22]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 消费顾客注册会员比例
  - elementId: t3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 434, 220, 36]
    content:
      style: "$statNum"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$accent"
      text: 63%
  - elementId: t3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 470, 220, 22]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: 注册会员 90 天复购率
  - elementId: pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 508, 80, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 09 / 12
